#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-mobile-releases.md:9
msgid "Mattermost releases a new mobile app version every month."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-mobile-releases.md:11
msgid ""
"See the [Mobile app changelog](/product-overview/mobile-app-changelog) "
"for release details, and see the [iOS mobile app](/end-user-guide/access"
"/install-ios-app) and the [Android mobile app](/end-user-guide/access"
"/install-android-app) documentation for installation details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-mobile-releases.md:14
msgid ""
"We strongly recommend using the latest mobile app release available that "
"contains the latest security fixes and user experience enhancements. "
"Mobile app releases are compatible with and tested against [supported "
"Mattermost server and extended support "
"releases](https://docs.mattermost.com/product-overview/mattermost-server-"
"releases.html#latest-releases)."
msgstr ""

